{
  "durationSeconds": 48.164,
  "title": "Moss training has has a very large speed boost in Fizgig",
  "source": "reddit",
  "sourceLabel": "Reddit",
  "domain": "github.com",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "kind": "hook",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.68,
      "text": "Training an image model LoRA used to take almost an hour. Now it takes twenty minutes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "start": 5.68,
      "end": 17.475,
      "text": "Fizgig is an open source studio for training, fixing and exploring LoRAs for image models like Flux, Qwen and SDXL. It runs on consumer GPUs, down to eight gigabytes.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "title",
        "title": "Fizgig: LoRA and fine-tune studio",
        "subtitle": "Open source, from 8 GB GPUs"
      },
      "shots": [{ "at": "Fizgig", "show": "RepoPage", "t": 5.92 }]
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "start": 17.475,
      "end": 25.715,
      "text": "The latest release moves to PyTorch 2.15. Training a MOSS-Image LoRA now takes about 20 minutes instead of 49.",
      "visual": { "type": "stat", "label": "MOSS-Image LoRA, RTX 5090", "value": "20 min" }
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "start": 25.715,
      "end": 35.4,
      "text": "Memory drops too. Krea 2 training falls from 22.9 to 14.9 gigabytes, and the Muon optimizer runs 12 times faster.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "title",
        "title": "Less memory, faster Muon",
        "subtitle": "Krea 2: 22.9 to 14.9 GB"
      },
      "shots": [
        {
          "at": "Muon",
          "show": "KeyPoint",
          "props": {
            "text": "Muon optimizer 12x faster",
            "sub": "Same results, far less time per step"
          },
          "t": 32.68
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "beat",
      "start": 35.4,
      "end": 44.639,
      "text": "You can also fix a broken LoRA block by block without retraining, and find the best epoch by eye. Watch the tour and try it on your own pictures.",
      "visual": {
        "type": "title",
        "title": "Fix and explore",
        "subtitle": "Block-level LoRA repair, epoch compare"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "outro",
      "start": 44.639,
      "end": 48.164,
      "text": "Check out shootthesound slash Fizgig on GitHub."
    }
  ],
