      "text": "Training is much faster, uses far less memory, and likeness is unchanged. On an RTX 5090, a MOSS-Image LoRA at batch 1 (94 pictures, Muon, 70 epochs) now takes about 20 minutes instead of 49. Other models have had speed boosts too, but Moss the most dramatic."
